'''Flow''' is an [[Effects|effect]] that was obtainable by purchasing the [[Ocean Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Summer Event 2023]]. It is now no longer obtainable as the gamepass has since went offsale.

== Appearance==
A blue, flowing aura encompasses the knife, hence the name. When it is equipped, light blue lines resembling the reflection of a swimming pool also surround the knife. When a player is killed by a knife with this effect, blue flames and particles are emitted from their body.  

==Trivia== 
*This is the only item within the [[Ocean Bundle]] that cannot be purchased from a separate gamepass.
*This is the first ever godly effect to be introduced to the game.

